<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Dashboard | SecureLocal</title><meta name="theme-color" content="#c2410c"><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 100 100%27%3E%3Ctext y=%27.9em%27 font-size=%2790%27%3E🍕%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/theme.js"></script><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><%- include('partials/nav',{user,csrfToken}) %><main class="container"><section class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT OVERVIEW</p><h1>Hello, <%= user.username %> <span class="wave-emoji">👋</span></h1><p class="lead">Signed in with role <span class="pill"><%= user.role %></span></p></section><section class="grid three"><a class="card card-link" href="/menu"><div class="icon">🍕</div><h2>Pizza menu</h2><p>Browse menu and place an order.</p></a><a class="card card-link" href="/orders"><div class="icon green">📦</div><h2>My orders</h2><p>Review your order history and status.</p></a><a class="card card-link" href="/mfa/my-data"><div class="icon blue">🗂️</div><h2>My Data</h2><p>Review and export your account data.</p></a><a class="card card-link" href="/mfa/setup"><div class="icon">🔐</div><h2>Multi-factor authentication</h2><p>Set up or strengthen your account with TOTP MFA.</p></a><a class="card card-link" href="/incidents/report"><div class="icon green">🚨</div><h2>Report an incident</h2><p>Send a privacy or security concern.</p></a><a class="card card-link" href="/incidents"><div class="icon blue">📋</div><h2>Incident reports</h2><p>Review your submitted reports.</p></a></section><% if(['Owner','Admin'].includes(user.role)){ %><section class="panel"><h2>🛠️ Administration</h2><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/admin">Security dashboard</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/audit-logs">Audit logs</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/users">User roles</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/menu">Manage menu</a></div></section><% } %></main></body></html>